+# Plain HTTP for internal hosts
+
+The project's current recorded decision is HTTPS everywhere, with no exceptions: plain HTTP is not permitted for internal hosts, and internal hosts are held to the same HTTPS requirement as every other connection. Certificate verification also remains enabled on all builds.
